    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-10-07T21:17:39+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-07T21:17:39+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-07T10:47:39Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-07T10:47:39Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A high pressure system located near Tasmania maintains a ridge over the state as it moves east into the Tasman Sea. A trough ahead of a strong cold front is expected move over western SA on Thursday, and track east across the rest of SA on Friday. A ridge remains over northern SA on Saturday while a series of troughs and cold fronts move across the state early next week.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW012" description="Lower Eyre Peninsula" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-10-07T21:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-08T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-07T10:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-07T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Clear. Light winds.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-10-08T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-09T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-07T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-08T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. High chance of showers near the west coast, medium chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm near the west coast in the evening. Winds north to northeasterly 20 to 30 km/h tending north to northwesterly 25 to 35 km/h during the day. Overnight temperatures falling to between 9 and 12 with daytime temperatures reaching the low 30s.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">Moderate</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:50am to 4:40pm, UV Index predicted to reach 8 [Very High]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-10-09T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-10T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-08T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-09T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. Very high chance of showers, most likely in the morning and afternoon. A thunderstorm likely in the morning and afternoon, possibly severe with damaging winds. Winds north to northwesterly 25 to 35 km/h turning westerly in the late afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to around 15 with daytime temperatures reaching the low 20s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-10-10T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-11T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-09T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-10T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower in the morning and afternoon. Winds westerly 25 to 35 km/h becoming light during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 9 and 12 with daytime temperatures reaching the low 20s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-10-11T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-12T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-10T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-11T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny morning. Medium chance of showers, most likely in the afternoon and evening. The chance of a thunderstorm in the afternoon and evening. Winds north to northeasterly 20 to 30 km/h tending northwesterly 25 to 35 km/h during the day then turning west to southwesterly 15 to 20 km/h during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 8 and 11 with daytime temperatures reaching the high 20s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
